- Analytics queries run on Postgres (the `analytics` schema). Use the query layer in
  - `./packages/db/src/analytics/sql.ts` (the `sql` tagged template, bound parameters)
  - `./packages/db/src/analytics/query-builder.ts` (dynamic queries)
  - `./packages/db/src/analytics/filters.ts` (event, profile, group and cohort filters)
